  "remarks": "Four charts agree on E, B, A, C#m and the order. None has bar lines: two bars per chord in the verse and a 12-bar chorus are worked out from 115 BPM, the 5:12 full version and the 3:59 edit. The two-bar lead-in and the chorus ending are guesses. The long fading outro is charted as six rounds.",
